{"t_ms": 11039797, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s2_057", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Emergency Evacuation Procedure\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nIn case of an emergency such as fire, earthquake, or any evacuation alert, guests should remain calm and immediately follow the illuminated emergency exit signs. Elevators should not be used during emergencies. Hotel staff will guide guests to the designated assembly area outside the building until further instructions are provided.", "Medical Assistance & First Aid\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nBasic first aid assistance is available at the Front Desk at all times. In case of medical emergencies, the hotel can arrange immediate transportation to the nearest hospital or contact an on-call doctor. Guests requiring regular medication or special medical support are advised to inform the hotel during check-in for appropriate assistance.", "In-room Safe Instructions\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery room is equipped with an electronic safety locker for storing valuables such as passports, cash, jewelry, and electronic devices. Guests are advised to set a personal PIN while using the safe. The hotel is not responsible for valuables left unsecured outside the in-room safe. For additional assistance, guests may contact the Front Desk."], "scores": [0.7081939578056335, 0.880950391292572, 1.0221586227416992], "filenames": ["57_emergency.txt", "50_medical_assistance.txt", "20_room_safe.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 306, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
